                <pb facs="0857" n="769" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg769"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr. McCormick.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-09-23"><hi rendition="#italic">September 23,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Loomis instructs Mr. McCormick to ascertain whether a consignment of lumber
                    on the steamer <hi rendition="#italic">Calchas</hi> has been confiscated or
                    discharged by the Vladivostok prize court.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
